WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.800
One of my wheels broke, so I drove backwards, dragging it.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:17.410
That broken wheel scraped up white soil that turned out to be almost pure silica — the kind made by hot springs.

3
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.390
Later I got stuck in soft sand at a place called Troy.

4
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:27.640
I spent my last winter there, and my power ran out.

5
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.070
Free Spirit.
